wiki\synthesis\client-acquisition-renovation-2026-07-03.md:218:**Wave 3 — client portal renovation.** Part 3 (Scoreboard, This week, Decisions, demo mode; upgraded Content view). Acceptance: a real client link shows only real or honestly-pending data; demo mode is watermarked on every widget; the portal and the landing page read as one product.
wiki\synthesis\business-bottleneck-audit-2026-06.md:32:What only the founder can do: **send.** The honest target for this week is not 100 touches; it is 2 — the two warm leads with already-drafted assets — then the daily cadence from the plan (4-6/day). The first `sent` row in the outreach log is the single most valuable event available to the business right now.
wiki\synthesis\pulsify-portal-master-architecture.md:95:Charts everywhere they help: retention curves, drop-off bars, reach donuts, pies. The design bar is the Trakyo system already locked.
wiki\synthesis\pulsify-portal-master-architecture.md:115:**Built and live:** the client dashboard (login, studio with generation and review, metrics with drop-off diagnosis), the integrations hub (UI, D1, signed webhooks, Discord alerts, Mark-paid onboarding trigger), the operator console `/admin`, outreach view/watch/IP tracking and off-page asset tracking, the Trakyo design system, the sequence and carousel design system, the reel engine (preview). CRM cross-browser sync and per-lead URLs.
wiki\synthesis\soowei-goh-extractions\03-408k-personal-brand-with-ai.md:74:Quote: "your team should come to you every single week with a report... I get an average of how many views I get in that week. I get the net follow[er] growth. I get the exact ICP leads gained... out of a 100 new followers this week around one was an ICP coach. That means that our messaging wasn't as dialed in... the follower to view ratio... You only want to compare last week and this week because when you compare month to month, there's too many pieces of content."
