wiki\content-engine\pulsify-vsl-v3.md:121:Timeline is three to six months depending on where your offer is when we start. The setter and closer on your sales team are paid on performance. They eat when you eat.
wiki\concepts\content-funnel-tof-mof-bof.md:103:Per Ayman: use Trakyo (trakyo.io; transcribed as "Trackio") to track calls booked per video and the full customer journey before each booking. Common patterns:
wiki\concepts\pulse-system-mechanism.md:33:The client's own knowledge vault. Their voice, their offer, their unique mechanism, their past content, their audience research, their performance data, their competitor set. Built in the first 7 days of engagement using transcripts of past calls, past videos, and a structured intake interview. Lives inside their own Claude project so they keep it forever and so the agent has memory across every other component.
claude-memory\feedback_cold_dm_formula.md:12:**The formula (five beats):** 1) casual lowercase opener ("yo been deep in your vids this week"), 2) one genuine specific reference to something they actually teach, dropped in the MIDDLE not the opener, plus a plain "really like it" (never glaze), 3) soft gap framed as opportunity not flaw ("also noticed you don't really have a page that captures people and educates them on what you can help with"), 4) the gift ("so i just went ahead and put one together for you"), 5) ownership + soft reply-inviting close ("it's 100% yours, take a look and lmk what you think [link]").
